      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2671,
      "bookHadithIndex": 53,
      "text": "It was narrated that Ibn 'Abbas said; \"I heard the Prophet delivering a khutbah and he said:'Pants (are allowed) for one who cannot find an Izar, and Khuffs for one who cannot find sandals to wear in Ihram.;;",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2671-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2671-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2671-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c648dd1a4c9c86f0a60d",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2672,
      "bookHadithIndex": 54,
      "text": "It was narrated that Ibn 'Abbas said; \"I heard the Messenger of Allah say:'Whoever cannot find an Izar, let him wear pants, and whoever cannot find sandals, let him wear khuffs",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2672-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2672-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2672-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c648dd1a4c9c86f0a60e",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2673,
      "bookHadithIndex": 55,
      "text": "It was narrated that Ibn 'Umar said; \"A man stood up and said:'O Messenger of Allah! What garments do you command us to wear in Ihran?' The Messenger of Allah said: 'Do not wear shirts or pants, or 'Imamahs, or burnouses, or Khuffs except if someone does not have sandals, in which case let him wear Khuffs that come below the ankles. And do not wear any garment that has been touched by (dyed with) saffron or Wars. And women should not cover their faces when in Ihram, or wear gloves",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2673-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
