      "bookHadithIndex": 61,
      "text": "It was narrated that Ibn 'Abbas said:\"I heard the Messenger of Allah say; 'If you cannot find an Izar then wear pants, and if you cannot find sandals then wear khuffs, but cut them so that they come lower than the ankles",
