    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a61d",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2688,
      "bookHadithIndex": 70,
      "text": "It was narrated that Aishah said:\"I put perfume on the Messenger of Allah for his exiting Ihram, and I put perfume on him for his Ihram, perfume which was not like this perfume of yours\" she meant that it does not last.(Shah)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2688-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2688-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2688-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a61e",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2689,
      "bookHadithIndex": 71,
      "text": "Uthman bin 'Urwah narrated that his father said:\"I said to 'Aishah: 'What kind of perfume did you put on the Messenger of Allah?' she said: 'The best kind of perfume, when he entered Ihram and when he exited Ihram",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2689-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2689-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2689-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a61f",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2690,
      "bookHadithIndex": 72,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Aishah said:\"I used to put perfume on the Messenger of Allah when he entered Ihram, using the best perfume I could find",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2690-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2690-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2690-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a620",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2691,
      "bookHadithIndex": 73,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Aishah said:\"I used to put perfume on the Messenger of Allah using the best I could find, when he entered Ihram and when he exited Ihram, and when he wanted to visit the House",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2691-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2691-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2691-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a621",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2692,
      "bookHadithIndex": 74,
      "text": "It was narrated that Al-Qasim said:\"'Aishah said: 'I put perfume on the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) before he entered Ihram and on the Day of Sacrifice before he circumambulated the House, using perfume containing musk",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2692-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2692-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2692-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a622",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2693,
      "bookHadithIndex": 75,
      "text": "It was narrated that Aishah said:\"It is as if I can see the glistening of the perfume on the head of the Messenger of Allah when he is in Ihram.\" Ahmad bin Nasr (one of the narrators) said in his narration: \"The glistening of the perfume of musk in the parting (of the hair) of the Messenger of Allah",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2693-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2693-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2693-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a623",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2694,
      "bookHadithIndex": 76,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Aishah said:\"The glistening of the perfume could be seen in the parting (of the hair) of the Messenger of Allah while he was in Ihram",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2694-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2694-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2694-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a624",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2695,
      "bookHadithIndex": 77,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Aishah said:\"It is as if I can see the glistening of the perfume on the head of the Messenger of Allah while he is in Ihram",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2695-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2695-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2695-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a625",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2696,
      "bookHadithIndex": 78,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Aishah said:\" I used to see the glistening of the perfume at the roots of the hair of the Messenger of Allah when he was in Ihram.(sahih)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2696-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2696-alalbani",
