        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a627",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2698,
      "bookHadithIndex": 80,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Aishah said:\"I saw the glistening of the perfume on the head of the Messenger of Allah while he was initiating Ihram",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2698-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2698-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2698-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a628",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2699,
      "bookHadithIndex": 81,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Aishah said:\"It is as if I can see the glistening of the perfume in parting of the Messenger of Allah while he was in Ihram. (sahih)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2699-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2699-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2699-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a629",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2700,
      "bookHadithIndex": 82,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Aishah said:\"When the Prophet and (in his narration) Hannad said: \"The Messenger of Allah \"wanted to enter Ihram, he would daub the best perfume that he could find, until I saw it glistening on his head and in his beard. (sahih)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2700-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2700-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2700-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a62a",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2701,
      "bookHadithIndex": 83,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Aishah said:\"I used to put perfume on the Messenger of Allah using the best perfume I could find, until I saw the perfume glistening on his head and in his beard, before he entered Ihram",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2701-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2701-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2701-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a62b",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2702,
      "bookHadithIndex": 84,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Aishah said:'I saw the glistening of the perfume in the parting of the Messenger of Allah after three (days)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2702-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2702-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2702-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a62c",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2703,
      "bookHadithIndex": 85,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Aishah said:'I used to see the glistening of the perfume in the parting of the Messenger of Allah after three (days)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2703-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih Lighairihi"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2703-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2703-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a62d",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2704,
      "bookHadithIndex": 86,
      "text": "It was narrated from Ibrahim bin Al-Muntashir that his father said:\"I asked Ibn 'Umar about wearing perfume when entering Ihram and he said: 'If I were to be daubed with tar that would be dearer to me than that, I mentioned that to 'Aishah and she said: 'May Allah have mercy on Abu 'Abdur-Rahman. I used to put perfume on the Messenger of Allah then he would go around his wives, then in the morning he would be smelling strongly of perfume",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2704-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2704-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2704-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a62e",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2705,
      "bookHadithIndex": 87,
      "text": "It was narrated from Muhammad bin Ibrahim bin Al-Muntashir that his father said:\"I heard Ibn 'Umar say: 'If I were to wake up daubed with tar, that would be dearer to me than waking up and entering Ihram smelling strongly of perfume.' I entered upon 'Aishah and told her what he had said. She said: 'I put perfume on the Messenger of Allah and he went around among his wives, then the next morning he entered Ihram",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2705-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2705-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2705-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a62f",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2706,
      "bookHadithIndex": 88,
      "text": "It was narrated that Anas Said:\"The Prophet forbade men to perfume themselves with saffron. (Shahih)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2706-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2706-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2706-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a630",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2707,
      "bookHadithIndex": 89,
      "text": "It was narrated that Anas bin Malik said:\"The Messenger of Allah forbade perfuming oneself with saffron",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2707-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih Lighairihi"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2707-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2707-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a631",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2708,
      "bookHadithIndex": 90,
      "text": "It was narrated that Anas said that:the Messenger of Allah forbade perfuming oneself with saffron\". Hammad said: \"Meaning, for men",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2708-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2708-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2708-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a632",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2709,
      "bookHadithIndex": 91,
      "text": "It was narrated from Safwan bin Ya'la, from his father, that:a man came to the Prophet who had initiated Ihram for 'Umrah, wearing sewn garments and having put on Khaluq. He said: \"I have initiated Ihram for 'Umrah, so what should I do?\" The Prophet said: \"What would you do if you were doing Hajj?\" He said: \"I would avoid this and wash it off.\" He said: \"Whatever you would do for Hajj, do it, for 'Umrah,\" (sahih)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2709-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2709-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2709-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a633",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2710,
      "bookHadithIndex": 92,
      "text": "It was narrated f rom Safwan bin Ya'la that his father saide:\"A man came to the Messenger of Allah when he was in Al-Jirranah wearing a Jubnah, and having applied Khauq to his beard and head. He said: 'O Messenger of Allah! I have entered Ihram for 'Umrah and I am as you see.' He said: 'Take off the Jubbah and wash off the perfume, and whatever you would do for Hajj, do it for 'Umrah",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2710-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2710-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2710-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a634",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2711,
      "bookHadithIndex": 93,
      "text": "It was narrated from Abn bin 'Uthman that his father said:'the messenger of Allah said concerning a Muhrim whose head or yes hurt: 'Let him smudge them with aloes, (sahih):",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2711-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2711-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
