    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a635",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2712,
      "bookHadithIndex": 94,
      "text": "It was narrated that Ja'far bin Muhammad said; \" My father said:'We came to Jabir and asked him about the Hajj of the Prophet. He told us that the Messenger of Allah said: \"Had I known when I set out what I know now, I would have brought the Jadi (sacrificial animal ) with me and I would not have made it 'Umrah. Whoever does not have a Jadi with him, let him exit Ihram and make it 'Umrah,\" 'Ali may Allah be ;eased with him, came from Yemen with a Hadi, and the Messenger of Allah brought a Hadi from Al-Madinah, Fatimah had put on a dyed garment and applied kohl to her eyes, and he ('Ali) said: \"I went to the Prophet to complain about that and find out whether she could do that, I said: 'O Messenger of Allah, Fatima had put on a dyed garment and applied kohl to her eyes, and she said, the Messenger of Allah told me to do that. 'He said: 'She is telling the truth, she is telling the truth, I told her to do that",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2712-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2712-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2712-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a636",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2713,
      "bookHadithIndex": 95,
      "text": "It was narrated from Ibn 'Abbas that:a man fell from his mount and it trampled him. The Messenger of Allah said: \"Wash him with water and lotus leaves, and he should be shrouded in two clothes, leaving his head and face bare, for he will be raised on the Day of Resurrection reciting the Talbiyah.\"(sahih)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2713-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2713-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2713-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a637",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2714,
      "bookHadithIndex": 96,
      "text": "It was narrated that Ibn 'Abbas Said:\" A man died, and the Messenger of Allah said: wash him with water and lotus leaves, and shroud him in his cloths, but do not cover his head and face, for he will be raised on the Day of Resurrection reciting the Talbiyah",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2714-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2714-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2714-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a638",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2715,
      "bookHadithIndex": 97,
      "text": "It was narrated from 'Aishah that:the Messenger of Allah performed Hajj only (Ifrad)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2715-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Daif"
