          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Shadh"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2715-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a639",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2716,
      "bookHadithIndex": 98,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Aishah said:\"The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) entered Ihram for Hajj (only)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2716-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2716-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2716-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a63a",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2717,
      "bookHadithIndex": 99,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Aishah said:\"We went out with the Messenger of Allah around the time of the new moon of Dhul-Hijjah, and the Messenger of Allah said: 'Whoever wishes to enter Ihram for Hajj, let him do so , and whoever wishes to enter Ihram for 'Umrah, let him do so",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2717-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2717-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-24-2717-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c677dd1a4c9c86f0a63b",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 24,
      "hadithIndex": 2718,
      "bookHadithIndex": 100,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Aishah said:\"We set out with the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) thinking that it was for nothing other than Hajj",
